        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space is Red</strong> is an alt-history sci-fi horror visual novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place aboard a Soviet starship in an alternate future where the USSR still exists and competes with the US for dominance in space. After a hyperspace jump to evade an ambush, the crew finds itself near a mysterious planet in a poorly explored sector of the known galaxy. Strange occurrences begin, and suspicion grows among the crew that a traitor may be in their midst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras/55845d011530e76dbfefab3d2de0fb13.avif?t=1764310196\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras_big/55845d011530e76dbfefab3d2de0fb13.avif?t=1764310196 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals are styled like a black-and-white comic book, drawing inspiration from retro-horror manga. Expect multiple endings, detective elements, numerous deaths, and, of course, an alien presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space is Red</strong> is a radical reimagining of the first Russian full-length visual novel, <i>«Красный космос»</i> (<i>&quot;Krasny kosmos&quot;</i> or <i>Red Space</i>), originally released in 2007. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras/72f32de6b04c0c88d2c4fdab91124f32.avif?t=1764310196\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras_big/72f32de6b04c0c88d2c4fdab91124f32.avif?t=1764310196 width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original game, <i>&quot;Krasny kosmos&quot;</i>, was never available digitally and was never translated into other languages. With <strong>Space is Red</strong>, this has finally changed.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space is Red</strong> is an alt-history sci-fi horror visual novel.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place aboard a Soviet starship in an alternate future where the USSR still exists and competes with the US for dominance in space. After a hyperspace jump to evade an ambush, the crew finds itself near a mysterious planet in a poorly explored sector of the known galaxy. Strange occurrences begin, and suspicion grows among the crew that a traitor may be in their midst.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras/55845d011530e76dbfefab3d2de0fb13.avif?t=1764310196\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras_big/55845d011530e76dbfefab3d2de0fb13.avif?t=1764310196 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals are styled like a black-and-white comic book, drawing inspiration from retro-horror manga. Expect multiple endings, detective elements, numerous deaths, and, of course, an alien presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space is Red</strong> is a radical reimagining of the first Russian full-length visual novel, <i>«Красный космос»</i> (<i>&quot;Krasny kosmos&quot;</i> or <i>Red Space</i>), originally released in 2007. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras/72f32de6b04c0c88d2c4fdab91124f32.avif?t=1764310196\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357480/extras_big/72f32de6b04c0c88d2c4fdab91124f32.avif?t=1764310196 width=1560 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original game, <i>&quot;Krasny kosmos&quot;</i>, was never available digitally and was never translated into other languages. With <strong>Space is Red</strong>, this has finally changed.</p>",
        "short_description": "Space is Red is an alt-history sci-fi horror visual novel set aboard a Soviet starship in an alternate future. The game features multiple endings, detective elements, mysterious deaths, and, of course, an alien presence.",
